{"version":3,"term":{"cols":80,"rows":24},"timestamp":1787604893,"idle_time_limit":1.5,"command":"./hack/demo-autoscaling.sh","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/bash"}}
[0.446, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m━━━ 1/4  A WebApp that asks to be autoscaled — note there are no resources set\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.116, "o", "webapp.platform.miportfolio.com/shop-api created\r\n"]
[10.749, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m━━━ 2/4  The CPU request was supplied, so the HPA has a denominator\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ kubectl get deployment shop-api-deployment -o jsonpath={\"  cpu request: \"}{.spec.template.spec.containers[0].resources.requests.cpu}{\"\\n\"}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.143, "o", "  cpu request: 100m\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "\u001b[0;33mWaiting for the metrics pipeline to report utilization ...\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[20.635, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ kubectl get hpa shop-api-autoscaler --no-headers\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.109, "o", "shop-api-autoscaler   Deployment/shop-api-deployment   cpu: 1%/50%   2     8     2     34s\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m━━━ 3/4  Driving real CPU load inside the pods\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.414, "o", "\u001b[0;33mThe metrics pipeline samples every ~30s, so the load takes a moment to show.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;33mFollowing the autoscaler:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.139, "o", "  cpu=1%/50%         replicas=2\r\n"]
[10.293, "o", "  cpu=1136%/50%      replicas=2\r\n"]
[0.161, "o", "\u001b[0;33mUtilization reached 1136% of the request; scaled to 4 replicas.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m━━━ 4/4  What the autoscaler decided, in its own words\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.148, "o", "Events:\r\n  Type    Reason             Age   From                       Message\r\n  ----    ------             ----  ----                       -------\r\n  Normal  SuccessfulRescale  40s   horizontal-pod-autoscaler  New size: 2; reason: Current number of replicas below Spec.MinReplicas\r\n  Normal  SuccessfulRescale  7s    horizontal-pod-autoscaler  New size: 4; reason: cpu resource utilization (percentage of request) above target\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0;90m$ kubectl get webapp,hpa --no-headers\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.142, "o", "webapp.platform.miportfolio.com/shop-api   nginxinc/nginx-unprivileged:1.27-alpine   2     False   56s\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "horizontalpodautoscaler.autoscaling/shop-api-autoscaler   Deployment/shop-api-deployment   cpu: 1136%/50%   2     8     2     56s\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[0;33mThe operator never wrote the replica count: with autoscaling on, that field\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;33mbelongs to the HPA. One writer per field.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.265, "x", "0"]
